Responsible (R): Store Manager / Sustainability Coordinator
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2610_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2610_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
